# Stage 7 add-on: item photos. Requires an owner/manager Bearer token and a company/item.
@base = http://localhost:8081
@companyId = 1
@itemId = 1
@token = PASTE_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Browse public items (includes imageUrl, which is null until a photo is uploaded)
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/items

### Upload/replace item photo (put your example-photo.png file in this same http/ folder)
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/items/{{itemId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PhotoBoundary

--PhotoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="screen.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./example-photo.png
--PhotoBoundary--

### Fetch public photo
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/items/{{itemId}}/image

### Delete photo (owner / manager)
DELETE {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/items/{{itemId}}/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
